  <h2 class="ph">How to use this MyCNBox spreadsheet</h2>
  <p class="pp">Search the catalog. Cite the dated JSON. Check coupons and shipping on their own pages. Pay and ship on mycnbox.com.</p>
  <ol class="local-steps">
    <li><strong>Search the catalog</strong><span> Filter finds on <a href="/mycnbox-spreadsheet/">/mycnbox-spreadsheet/</a>. You do not need Excel or a Reddit thread to open the list.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Cite the dated dataset</strong><span> Public JSON on <a href="/finds-dataset/">/finds-dataset/</a>. We do not invent a higher count.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Check coupons separately</strong><span> Offers change in the official app. This hub logs what we last verified on <a href="/mycnbox-coupons/">/mycnbox-coupons/</a>.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Ship with a real country</strong><span> Freight needs a real country on <a href="https://www.mycnbox.com/estimation/" rel="noopener">mycnbox.com/estimation/</a> — not this hostname, and not “EU” as one country.</span></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="pp">Register and pay only on mycnbox.com. This page does not take payment and does not coach a declared value.</p>
