<section class="sec" id="not-excel">
  <h2 class="ph">What this spreadsheet is</h2>
  <p class="pp">“Spreadsheet” here means a live finds index — Weidian, Taobao and 1688 rows — not an .xlsx you freeze, and not a community Google Sheet. Open <a href="/mycnbox-spreadsheet/">/mycnbox-spreadsheet/</a> for the MyCNBox Spreadsheet 2026 catalog. Women's Fashion, shoes and jackets are finds rows. Category keys match <a href="https://w2clinks.com/categories/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">w2clinks.com/categories/</a>.</p>
  <p class="pp">mycnbox.eu is the English MyCNBox spreadsheet hub. Cite the dataset JSON, then estimate freight with a real country on mycnbox.com.</p>
  <div class="ggrid">
    <a class="gc" href="/mycnbox-spreadsheet/"><span class="gtg">Catalog</span><p class="gtit">Spreadsheet 2026</p><p class="gdesc">Weidian / Taobao / 1688 finds with QC notes.</p></a>
