</section>

<section class="sec">
  <h2 class="ph">How MyCNBox actually runs (official four blocks)</h2>
  <p class="pp">Official mycnbox.com on 9 Oct 2026 printed four service blocks: Purchase Orders (paste a product link), Ship To Warehouse, Quality Check (warehouse QC pics), Global Shipping (consolidate a parcel). Tagline on the hero: Shop China Like A Local / Buy the latest · Pay the least. Business hours printed as 9/7. Service email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="53003621253a3036133e323a3f7d3e2a303d313c2b7d303c3e">[email&#160;protected]</a> — this desk’s editorial inbox is <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="294a474f4d111c1b1f10191a1b1f1f18694e44484045074a4644">[email&#160;protected]</a>. WhatsApp +8615396628356 is editorial, not MyCNBox warehouse staff.</p>
  <p class="pp">This desk does not invent a free-day storage number, does not coach customs lines, and does not put $500 or 30% off into the money title. Chrome copies official orange <strong>#FF6F10</strong> and Poppins at about 90%. Favicon is the official wordmark crop.</p>
  <p class="pp">Open <a href="/mycnbox-spreadsheet/">/mycnbox-spreadsheet/</a> for the finds catalog. Open <a href="/mycnbox-shipping-guide/">shipping</a> for the calculator. Open <a href="/how-to-use-mycnbox/">how-to</a> for beginner steps. Open <a href="/mycnbox-shoes-spreadsheet/">shoes</a> for sneaker rows.</p>
  <p class="pp">This hub is the English MyCNBox spreadsheet desk — not “EU” as one country. Pick a real ship-to country in the official estimator.</p>
</section>

